      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8f842244fdbce862726ae9fdbf99d29613d4cbcff82ccb728686ead74a6f373b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1566ede03e88be84fbadb285be62c08aa42d3efd87b81df3785523e988fb261a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "足见种树成林要比教育人民，改造社会风气容易的多，占的时间短。",
      "output_sha256": "402aa0a477aff8f41b0b7f298fe2bf35f88dcce182a6f9ccb218ac9c1044cb3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "402aa0a477aff8f41b0b7f298fe2bf35f88dcce182a6f9ccb218ac9c1044cb3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，这句古语被我们打破了。",
      "output_sha256": "38e99bf6dfe78f7bbc76225476652050d4e8db15dc1b122ec02d2827851012fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "38e99bf6dfe78f7bbc76225476652050d4e8db15dc1b122ec02d2827851012fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "看看我们的社会，尽管建国才短短十年，不仅到处绿意盎然，新的社会风气也已悄然树立。",
      "output_sha256": "008e3304bb92a5450a6e3cb8c5e2f11d7dd17c5d8bce1607989b0ef9c58fe8ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.545789,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b3dfff1929150d1671cd05902697ab0eff329c354d4f5fa70932b6fbaa1109dc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "008e3304bb92a5450a6e3cb8c5e2f11d7dd17c5d8bce1607989b0ef9c58fe8ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北京的天桥是个最突出的例子。",
      "output_sha256": "0bd0b140ececf9c984aa86b421d08182ed146e60f72991b2a58eeec7e9e3f962",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "0bd0b140ececf9c984aa86b421d08182ed146e60f72991b2a58eeec7e9e3f962",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在1958年大跃进中，关于学习天桥、赶天桥的声音响彻全国，仿佛天桥自古以来就是最美的地方。",
      "output_sha256": "139c2ce30504b6e6690202ac18b69d071dc2cb50f2873c80b40852ba093e8cb2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.582941,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "55b74dc392e4be72e14f6d09dccb5f9642d6fd6dc59f7092988139b782935978",
        "4ec3e8545026e822fc642fda861cf74c6b85097bc0e69110fc85cd668f475810"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "139c2ce30504b6e6690202ac18b69d071dc2cb50f2873c80b40852ba093e8cb2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "事实上，在解放前，天桥是北京的最混乱与黑暗的地方，不要说城内外的妇女，就是老实的男人也轻易不敢到那里去招灾惹祸。",
      "output_sha256": "d1aa772ab4c1f737fb302ba72f4ce2e0abbe2c848bbde0118e9146c8506e7721",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1aa772ab4c1f737fb302ba72f4ce2e0abbe2c848bbde0118e9146c8506e7721",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那里的恶霸与流氓，见到外来的游客，若是觉得其衣着不合眼缘，便会上前拳打脚踢。",
      "output_sha256": "71e6cbf00cfea45db34a2b6677d82e547042c3c39e890da0ab62cc7f74c4ecb2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.436527,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9bebc416e1ee6658c87ae994505e9c5e1e7e75d73cae9cecaca7c4cf97788ab4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "71e6cbf00cfea45db34a2b6677d82e547042c3c39e890da0ab62cc7f74c4ecb2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那里打伤或打死一两个人，根本不算什么新鲜事。",
      "output_sha256": "07bb2464e4ea236ff9368ff9bf638536f4ec805b0ce5aa8f60fb941b0502f945",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "07bb2464e4ea236ff9368ff9bf638536f4ec805b0ce5aa8f60fb941b0502f945",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在那里谋生活的艺人，特别是女艺人，要不给恶霸们一些便宜，就没法混下去。",
      "output_sha256": "1f1910d5f4d6da3060af41a0c1196a270b7c47624fc58f5761f5a8119aa89e76",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f1910d5f4d6da3060af41a0c1196a270b7c47624fc58f5761f5a8119aa89e76",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那里的巡警与宪兵也行同恶霸，并且与恶霸狼狈为奸，欺压劳苦人民。",
      "output_sha256": "9d6bef0431eaf2b594acdb35da713774d2e9f2a73f43db6b8e95f1414e9bf671",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d6bef0431eaf2b594acdb35da713774d2e9f2a73f43db6b8e95f1414e9bf671",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "当时的骗子，凭借巧言令色，利用假药假货骗取人们辛苦得来的钱财。",
      "output_sha256": "74d9228fc3e25d64749af71b86e65ea17e1eaef0ad9ae666823b873005bcfeb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.44595,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6ac2c3876b3ca7f205c95d391a15bdab7cdb396cb7b23f0495a6465832fbfe5d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "74d9228fc3e25d64749af71b86e65ea17e1eaef0ad9ae666823b873005bcfeb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那里有大批的扒手，有组织地进行偷窃，被人捉住的时候，他们会相互支援，反把丢东西的人打个半死。",
      "output_sha256": "bde65f0047aff1c0754a461cb864545f09e81a5b0575ca06ab63c5de5d5dff27",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "bde65f0047aff1c0754a461cb864545f09e81a5b0575ca06ab63c5de5d5dff27",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "从前的天桥就是这样。",
      "output_sha256": "19e73a157477e721110ead1445cd90b1b9e8f36d08d74a0d7bef3d836b8be4b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "19e73a157477e721110ead1445cd90b1b9e8f36d08d74a0d7bef3d836b8be4b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "解放后，天桥逐渐焕发新生。",
      "output_sha256": "b8dbb001f8299138a47caebd5cf58cedb8d4661b69747dd584e1b3d9eff8a145",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.545455,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "625904fbc51e9bfdc920318c9f0090421e0072dc56b006fcbabf12d0a02a3428"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b8dbb001f8299138a47caebd5cf58cedb8d4661b69747dd584e1b3d9eff8a145",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "首先是有血债的恶霸都跪在了人民面前。",
      "output_sha256": "1691dfe984c9f64d91bd11f84fb948283b46313cd9b131818d5bde736ce3c585",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "1691dfe984c9f64d91bd11f84fb948283b46313cd9b131818d5bde736ce3c585",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是的，我还记得公审恶霸的情景。",
      "output_sha256": "80bfb01eced7f8458a294fe5a59addb9bb37b8c095166a5f971649c578a16085",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "80bfb01eced7f8458a294fe5a59addb9bb37b8c095166a5f971649c578a16085",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一个长于掼跤的恶霸，一向以老实人们作练习腰腿的对象，拉过来就摔，摔伤摔死都活该。",
      "output_sha256": "8d7b7c36eb37a742736dad0a6ab6dcecac00879d62c6f46587cb7a86ed66cdd2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d7b7c36eb37a742736dad0a6ab6dcecac00879d62c6f46587cb7a86ed66cdd2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "当人民警察押着他进入法庭的时候，一些善心的劳动人民高声地警告警察：离他远一点，他的腿厉害！",
      "output_sha256": "117bd170ea769c360df816b464a466f5c1e64ec211e83f81cfaaaab78dc2086a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "117bd170ea769c360df816b464a466f5c1e64ec211e83f81cfaaaab78dc2086a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，恶霸已面无人色，两腿齐颤，立不住了。",
      "output_sha256": "b446b1a57190468014d22321edcf58df660ff719849b5115c00e653ce808bf66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "b446b1a57190468014d22321edcf58df660ff719849b5115c00e653ce808bf66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "另一个恶霸竟自昏了过去。",
      "output_sha256": "16744288e4c35b5cf41d441061da6d354f287d725d029fb6da4cbcef34a66ef8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "16744288e4c35b5cf41d441061da6d354f287d725d029fb6da4cbcef34a66ef8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们明白，自身罪行累累，末日已然来临。",
      "output_sha256": "53653930d84a4512ee531abdd6c7da1e0387c4bb455ab0eac3b083f1375ae967",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.416,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c35dbd99ebf020a3c40540b52df0ace493471cb926d68fa5505b1d44a49c928a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "53653930d84a4512ee531abdd6c7da1e0387c4bb455ab0eac3b083f1375ae967",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "几十年来，他们是霸是虎。",
      "output_sha256": "164d98269d28ade8a9b173f161fb3efda9eea2316f093cc533b29873406edc56",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "164d98269d28ade8a9b173f161fb3efda9eea2316f093cc533b29873406edc56",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "人民翻了身，霸与虎的威风无法保持了。",
      "output_sha256": "d680fd090b6707e04b88765e3ea660f5252484dba3ec7cd42fa78018d83fbf7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "d680fd090b6707e04b88765e3ea660f5252484dba3ec7cd42fa78018d83fbf7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们并没有什么超人的本领。",
      "output_sha256": "acd04a2071a279909ead20be1c8951763bdacfbd5fb327aa4aa7a74b71386c6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "acd04a2071a279909ead20be1c8951763bdacfbd5fb327aa4aa7a74b71386c6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们敢于横行霸道是国民党与日本侵略者给了他们特权，他们也甘心为虎作伥。",
      "output_sha256": "4b4978172d2bfdebb9458d05662dee77dc23d029e3b7db71265a1960e0ecf5ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "4b4978172d2bfdebb9458d05662dee77dc23d029e3b7db71265a1960e0ecf5ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "恶霸的崛起并非偶然，他们是当时统治者的爪牙，代表着某种政治势力。",
      "output_sha256": "a7f81cc27dc9e3fc57369f3f3a4d371c668f7910a032d4b5fcba52b00156f4fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.695558,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "07bc65be49d445a591114eb5865106ac15dee7f1402e079b159e6933af376583"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a7f81cc27dc9e3fc57369f3f3a4d371c668f7910a032d4b5fcba52b00156f4fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "除非遇到人民专政，恶霸们是不会彻底垮台的。",
      "output_sha256": "6760b079d57212fbb5b18fd41d6aa9c9845b4e4517858c4c931f98b40fb638c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "6760b079d57212fbb5b18fd41d6aa9c9845b4e4517858c4c931f98b40fb638c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如今，恶霸们低下了头，而人民则抬起了头。",
      "output_sha256": "703e83b5a3beb13b3ebeeb905e3293f7532fcf7169c4e4c45b8306cc2090070f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.586931,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7b3882237d9dc26036ae6a280fcb6dbac50e8291802a6944ad30deca677ddda4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "703e83b5a3beb13b3ebeeb905e3293f7532fcf7169c4e4c45b8306cc2090070f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们明白政治的清明前所未有，因而向党和政府靠拢。",
      "output_sha256": "390b39edef0b0dba42858c2a42050582be3a03fc7782ce39a1b6ecbc6a58a288",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.527058,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31,
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3bc9e53a26e5afb19024e025e93a2f72c9026d0968bf678539ba5d27ba0815fe",
        "1f0678292f01123764217a64364a7ebf1bf2f73d562505e212f65b7dd5b0857d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
