      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "从前，他们躲着国民党与政府，躲得远远的；他们知道国民党与那时候的政府是和恶霸们串通一气，狼狈为奸的。",
      "output_sha256": "69d54a1130e1cb9da081103ab1bf80cc9e69d259f601657d836b70f6dfd86f21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "69d54a1130e1cb9da081103ab1bf80cc9e69d259f601657d836b70f6dfd86f21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "曾经，他们躲避国民党与政府，如今看到恶霸一个个倒下，心中豁然开朗。",
      "output_sha256": "1f8a9d32803154909514b6297b1952c790923790e4978ffd5d7c59318449d0d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.383347,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "49a5cc60bc8d69ce5fb4b66b178d62debaa9dcf3925c9817eec0f868a7224b6f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1f8a9d32803154909514b6297b1952c790923790e4978ffd5d7c59318449d0d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们开始拿出主人翁的态度，组织起来，与扒手和流氓们进行斗争。",
      "output_sha256": "9934fc197282271f0f8edf72ebd4391d07bb70239d1df66443d14c4940ba623d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "9934fc197282271f0f8edf72ebd4391d07bb70239d1df66443d14c4940ba623d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只要小偷一来到，大家就一齐准备好拿贼。",
      "output_sha256": "50ffd2df51daea31a6a7585f4253800eced452a17fa57a3ca9512448846aa082",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "50ffd2df51daea31a6a7585f4253800eced452a17fa57a3ca9512448846aa082",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们不仅依靠人民警察，更与之紧密合作。",
      "output_sha256": "abcc19fde8253f2cd4a2dbbc0bbe0beaed396e831b9b5d594498a4a03613eec5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.501003,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4259fbd4d0dcaba2b688fa663ce0edc0182847cb529284165c6a4dc27553a12d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "abcc19fde8253f2cd4a2dbbc0bbe0beaed396e831b9b5d594498a4a03613eec5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "天桥不再混乱了。",
      "output_sha256": "5b320884d4f4909332dfa76b152d83ec7dc7ddee855e77dc8a0a6b51a65d33f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "5b320884d4f4909332dfa76b152d83ec7dc7ddee855e77dc8a0a6b51a65d33f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们也切实地执行了清洁卫生工作，作到处处干净。",
      "output_sha256": "1351f509d2346d54170845eabeff1856e28ddce7128c0714f276dadac5284b18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "1351f509d2346d54170845eabeff1856e28ddce7128c0714f276dadac5284b18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这种风气的树立，就给大跃进创造了条件。",
      "output_sha256": "3b29817ab676d7e22f6ee60df25f95780abab8d3f26a6c5a8ef3e42a81e1c2b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "3b29817ab676d7e22f6ee60df25f95780abab8d3f26a6c5a8ef3e42a81e1c2b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "天桥的变化，显然并非偶然，而是数年政治教育与革命斗争的成果。",
      "output_sha256": "22446005f908741b0d744917b177a6e1e03bc623991ee0da88520cc3b5430e32",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.538071,
