      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "57338500418d3d0e0fb22ecd31f6e75d065a0deb8a0a0b3afebefa25f05062a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "天桥不再是可怕的，而是可爱的，值得羡慕与学习的地方了。",
