      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a627f1270ba06dc11d26dfe67f129a5e9b431044165a2291e845aa85fd1009fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "欣值建国十周年的伟大节日，我们都该要求自己努力前进，使已经树立的新社会风气日日发展，把我们的广大的国土迅速变成地上乐园！",
      "output_sha256": "e2f6a39178aa6d86157e8fe32a9ce08906db7c2f5d4af4e03bf4017d359e7c5b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
